  "title": "习近平在银川考察调研",
  "date": "2020-06-10 07:27:08",
  "author": "新华社“新华视点”微博",
  "editor": "(责编：王静                        )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p>\n　　习近平总书记9日在银川考察调研。他先后来到贺兰县稻渔空间乡村生态观光园、贺兰山东麓葡萄种植园，了解当地发展特色农业产业、加强贺兰山生态保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰、王晔、燕雁）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100727000493668179388.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100728000059317246652.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100728000180213138343.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100728000307867072107.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100728000422743258615.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100728000542547490571.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100729000142790530200.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100729000325746547993.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2020/0610/MAIN202006100729000421709002032.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "习近平总书记9日在银川考察调研。他先后来到贺兰县稻渔空间乡村生态观光园、贺兰山东麓葡萄种植园，了解当地发展特色农业产业、加强贺兰山生态保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰、王晔、燕雁）"
